In order to build the ESPet, we need a few components : 
Microcontroller : ESP32 Wroom, Devkits, Or best bet will be ESP32 DevKit C
Display : SSD1306 OLED Display 128x64 I2C
Sound : Active Buzzer
Power : Lion/Lipo Battery 3.7V, Mini Slide Switch
Charging : TP4056 Type C 
Sensors : Pushbutton 4 pin/2 pin, 0-25V Voltage sensor module. Warning : Do NOT Oversupply current to the ESP32 Pin
Happy Building :)
